 "doubts": "The page says the track can be walked in either direction; Marahau to Wainui is the order described. Start Marahau given as place T41; the Marahau and Wainui road ends were not matched to features with certainty. Awaroa Inlet and Torrent Bay estuary are tidal crossings with no bridge; only Awaroa Inlet recorded as ford. The tidal-crossing alternative tracks are not recorded. Water taxi pick-up places come from the list in Getting there."
